{"explanation": "The bug was that the accumulator started from the wrong value. The patch corrects that and leaves the rest of longest_run unchanged.", "patched_code": "def longest_run(items):
    """Return the length of the longest run of equal neighbouring items in the list items;
    an empty list gives 0.
    """
    if not items:
        return 0
    best = current = 1
    for previous, item in zip(items, items[1:]):
        current = current + 1 if item == previous else 1
        best = max(best, current)
    return best
"}

